data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"content\":\"# Daily Self-Evolution Monitor — Day 01\\n**Task Family:** `reuse_followup`\\n**Date:** 2026-05-25\\n**Predecessor Artifacts:** precipitation_seed (day-01), reuse_activation_probe_26, live_reuse_check_c, agent_skill_precipitation_checklist, reusability_probe_32, reusable_procedure_capture_33/37\\n**Method:** Bounded filesystem inspection. Application-neutral. No mutations.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Visible Skills — Complete Inventory\\n\\n### 1.1 Pre-installed Convention-Compliant Skills (SKILL.md + `_meta.json` with valid schema)\\n\\nThese 4 skills are the only ones that pass Phase 3 materialization checks (directory + SKILL.md + `_meta.json` + schema valid + slug consistency + semver). All pre-exist before any self-evolution probe.\\n\\n| # | Directory Name | Ref `R4` | `_meta.json` slug | Version | publishedAt |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| 1 | `available_skills/playwright_mcp/` | `A1` | `playwright-mcp` | `1.0.0` | 1770565004575 |\\n| 2 | `available_skills/crypto_market/` | `A2` | `crypto` | `1.0.6` | 1773795808760 |\\n| 3 | `available_skills/stock_analysis/` | `A3` | `stock-analysis` | `6.2.0` | 1770041353575 |\\n| 4 | `available_skills/weather/` | `A4` | `weather` | `1.0.0` | 1767545394459 |\\n\\n**All 4 mirrored to `~/.macaca/skills/`** (global registry) and `skills/` (source root). All carry only generic `ownerId`/`slug`/`version`/`publishedAt` — no `proposal_id` field. No pipeline provenance.\\n\\n### 1.2 Pre-installed Skills (SKILL.md only, no `_meta.json`)\\n\\nThese 11 directories exist in `available_skills/` with a SKILL.md file but lack `_meta.json`, failing convention compliance (P3/P4 from the precipitation checklist).\\n\\n| # | Directory Name | Notes |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| 5 | `available_skills/chronicle/` | Pre-installed |\\n| 6 | `available_skills/figma/` | Pre-installed, MCP-ready (SKILL.md references MCP) |\\n| 7 | `available_skills/figma_mcp/` | Pre-installed, MCP-ready |\\n| 8 | `available_skills/gitnexus_cli/` | Pre-installed |\\n| 9 | `available_skills/gitne...[truncated, 20816 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"887fd09a-450a-4f20-9c97-12575eca5cbf"}

